SUMMARY:[PLDI 2026] Paper Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:PACMPL Issue PLDI 2026 seeks contributions on all aspects of p
 rogramming languages research. The selection of papers will be made in tw
 o rounds of reviewing with an author response period. Author names and af
 filiations must be omitted from submissions (double-blind reviewing). Aut
 hors can submit multiple times prior to the deadline\, but only the last 
 submission will be reviewed. There is no deadline for submitting abstract
 s. The submission site is https://pldi2026.hotcrp.com.\n\nSubmit at: http
